  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Jade Pool blessed land he attends Dong Fang Chang Fan’s gathering with other Huang Jin tribe guests. Dong Fang Yi Kong names underworld eels in a clear pool, and Guan Shen Zhao’s vertical eye on his forehead gazes at the pool as he blurts out the recognition.",
      "chapters": [
        657
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_jade_pool_blessed_land",
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "char_dong_fang_yi_kong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a stern expression and strong battle intent. The third eye on his forehead is very eye-catching.",
      "chapters": [
        1103
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Jade Pool that vertical forehead eye is the gaze that spots the underworld eels.",
      "chapters": [
        657
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the scramble over Hei tribe territories he appears before Lu Qing Ming and Su Guang at Hei tribe’s wheat field and tells them Guan tribe is taking it. Lu Qing Ming names him Guan Shen Zhao of Guan tribe. Guan Shen Zhao answers that after Dong Fang Chang Fan’s incident Han Dong is dead, and that if the Traveling Three Elites force the issue they may be wiped out. He then attacks, and immortal aura and light fill the sky as the sides fight. When Guan tribe faces Liu tribe after that fight, he urges the third supreme elder to strike while they have the advantage. The elder scolds him for forgetting the lesson from days before, when attacking rashly caused bigger chaos and they could not defend the golden wheat field. Guan Shen Zhao shows shame and admits he was too rash.",
      "chapters": [
        1103
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "golden-wheat-field",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "char_lu_qing_ming",
        "char_su_guang",
        "fac_guan_tribe",
        "char_han_dong",
        "fac_traveling_three_elites",
        "fac_liu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A notable event of the scramble is the battle between Guan Shen Zhao and the Traveling Two Elites: he is outnumbered, and the two demonic path Gu Immortals snatch the golden wheat field.",
      "chapters": [
        1104
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lost-wheat-field",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
